      "mergeID": "6973a0f0d5c93c8756eb6f56",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Hello VRChat Support Team,\n\nI am having an issue with the VRChat website.\n\nWhen I go to the Avatars page and click on any of my avatars, the page stays on an infinite loading screen and never opens the avatar details page.\n\nDetails:\n\n- All of my avatars are uploaded correctly and work in VRChat\n\n- Both Private and Public avatars are affected\n\n- The issue happens on PC using Google Chrome\n\n- I have tried incognito mode, clearing cache, re-uploading avatars, and changing one avatar to Public, but the issue persists\n\nIt seems that my account’s avatar data on the website may not be syncing correctly.\n\nCould you please check my account and help fix this issue?\n\nThank you very much for your time.\n\nBest regards,",
      "mergedPostTitle": "vrchat avater",
      "parentID": null,
