      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6970ccca6cefe3c23855fbd6|full_name} VRChat's Canny platform isn't VRChat Support Team, this is a public bug tracker. My avatar page loads fine on the website, you may be experiencing an isolated issue. Contact VRChat support at https://vrch.at/support.\n\nReproducible VRChat website bug reports are best to be filed at https://feedback.vrchat.com/website.",
